  "prefLabel": "Ph 2406.01 Immunity",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 2406.01 Immunity. The board shall not penalize licensed pharmacists under this chapter for following standing orders that contains a defect as long as the requirements in Ph 2400 and RSA 318:47-1 are satisfied.\n\nSource. #13343, eff 2-17-22",
